Source Sans Pro (embedded in docs/architecture/*.svg)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright 2010-2018 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name
'Source'. All Rights Reserved.
Source: https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-sans, vendored by D2
        (https://github.com/terrastruct/d2, d2renderers/d2fonts)
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 — see
licenses/OFL-1.1-source-sans-pro.txt

The architecture diagrams in docs/architecture/ are rendered from D2 source by
the @terrastruct/d2 development dependency. D2 embeds a subset of Source Sans
Pro into each generated SVG as base64 WOFF, so the file renders identically
everywhere without a network call. Those subsets are committed to this
repository and therefore travel with every clone, which is what makes the OFL's
notice requirement apply — the same reason the Geist entry above exists.

D2 itself is not listed here. It is a development dependency that renders the
files at author time; none of its own code ends up in them. Its MPL-2.0 license
is recorded in docs/asset-inventory.md.

