npm dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not redistributed by this repository: the project is distributed as source and
each clone installs its own dependencies. Their licenses are recorded in
docs/asset-inventory.md and must be re-reviewed if the distribution model ever
changes to a bundled or binary deliverable (AB#42).

